# This directory contains Firebase data backups
# Backup files are automatically generated and should not be committed to git
# 
# Backup files are created with timestamps:
# - firebase-backup-YYYY-MM-DDTHH-mm-ss-sssZ.json
# - latest-backup.json (symlink to most recent backup)
#
# To create a backup:
# node scripts/backup-firebase-data.js
#
# To restore from backup:
# node scripts/restore-firebase-data.js [backup-file]
